 "texts": [
  {
   "x": 107,
   "y": 190,
   "text": "1. Sign in"
  },
  {
   "x": 107,
   "y": 230,
   "text": "2. redirect \u2192 login page (username / password, MFA in Entra)"
  },
  {
   "x": 107,
   "y": 255,
   "text": "authorization_endpoint on the public issuer (localhost:8180)",
   "color": "grey"
  },
  {
   "x": 307,
   "y": 278,
   "text": "3. code \u2192 token exchange (server side)"
  },
  {
   "x": 307,
   "y": 303,
   "text": "via OIDC_INTERNAL_ISSUER (keycloak:8080); access + refresh token in encrypted cookie",
   "color": "grey"
  },
  {
   "x": 107,
   "y": 388,
   "text": "4. POST /api/agents/{slug}/run"
  },
  {
   "x": 107,
   "y": 413,
   "text": "RunAgentInput {threadId, runId, messages}",
   "color": "grey"
  },
  {
   "x": 307,
   "y": 436,
   "text": "5. + Authorization: Bearer <access token>"
  },
  {
   "x": 307,
   "y": 461,
   "text": "+ x-agui-thread-id",
   "color": "grey"
  },
  {
   "x": 707,
   "y": 551,
   "text": "6. POST /run (no user token)"
  },
  {
   "x": 707,
   "y": 576,
   "text": "x-langflow-flow-id \u00b7 x-end-user-id \u00b7 x-api-key",
   "color": "grey"
  },
  {
   "x": 907,
   "y": 666,
   "text": "7. POST /api/v2/workflows"
  },
  {
   "x": 907,
   "y": 691,
   "text": "flow_id \u00b7 input_value \u00b7 session_id = threadId",
   "color": "grey"
  },
  {
   "x": 1107,
   "y": 766,
   "text": "8. POST /v1/chat/completions"
  },
  {
   "x": 1107,
   "y": 791,
   "text": "runtime key \u00b7 x-end-user-id \u00b7 x-agent-slug \u00b7 x-agui-thread-id",
   "color": "grey"
  },
  {
   "x": 1307,
   "y": 810,
   "text": "9. ollama/qwen3:8b \u2192 Ollama"
  },
  {
   "x": 1307,
   "y": 835,
   "text": "Logs/Analytics: user, agent, tokens",
   "color": "grey"
  },
  {
   "x": 1107,
   "y": 854,
   "text": "10. tool call (make_api_request \u2192 business API)"
  },
  {
   "x": 907,
   "y": 904,
   "text": "11. AG-UI SSE events"
  },
  {
   "x": 907,
   "y": 929,
   "text": "TEXT_MESSAGE_* \u00b7 TOOL_CALL_* \u00b7 RUN_FINISHED",
   "color": "grey"
  },
  {
   "x": 107,
   "y": 954,
   "text": "12. same events with the client's threadId/runId, langflow.* dropped \u2192 back through gateway and portal"
  },
  {
   "x": 107,
   "y": 979,
   "text": "portal renders tokens, tool cards, markdown",
   "color": "grey"
  },
  {
   "x": 907,
   "y": 1122,
   "text": "13. CUSTOM langflow.human_input_required"
  },
  {
   "x": 907,
   "y": 1147,
   "text": "request_id \u00b7 options \u00b7 prompt",
   "color": "grey"
  },
  {
   "x": 107,
   "y": 1170,
   "text": "14. RUN_FINISHED {outcome: interrupt}"
  },
  {
   "x": 107,
   "y": 1195,
   "text": "id = job + request + event id \u00b7 message \u00b7 responseSchema (options) \u00b7 expiresAt",
   "color": "grey"
  },
  {
   "x": 107,
   "y": 1224,
   "text": "15. new run with resume: [{interruptId, status, payload: {action_id}}]"
  },
  {
   "x": 107,
   "y": 1249,
   "text": "via portal (Bearer) and gateway (JWT, roles) as in 4\u20136",
   "color": "grey"
  },
  {
   "x": 907,
   "y": 1274,
   "text": "16. POST /{job}/resume + GET /{job}/events (Last-Event-ID)"
  },
  {
   "x": 907,
   "y": 1299,
   "text": "cancelled \u2192 POST /stop \u00b7 other user \u2192 'job not found'",
   "color": "grey"
  },
  {
   "x": 107,
   "y": 1324,
   "text": "17. remaining events (branch output / tool result, answer) \u2192 portal"
  },
  {
   "x": 107,
   "y": 1349,
   "text": "as in 11\u201312",
   "color": "grey"
  },
  {
   "x": 40,
   "y": 14,
   "text": "Agent platform \u00b7 data flow",
   "size": "l"
  },
  {
   "x": 40,
   "y": 1628,
   "text": "Secrets never in the browser: tokens stay in the portal's encrypted cookie; the Langflow key is added by the gateway; provider keys live only in the gateway. Dashed = responses / streams.",
   "size": "s",
   "w": 1500
  }
 ],
